# Build context for containers/aarch64/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this instead of the root .dockerignore): the root
# file's list plus the X-VLA checkout and LIBERO assets that build.sh puts in the context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!src/
!tests/
!References/
!containers/
!xvla-src/
!libero-assets/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
